<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Martti Ahtisaari</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates"><a href="/years/1937">1937</a>–<a href="/years/2023">2023</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/20th-century">20th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Martti Ahtisaari (1937–2023) was a Finnish diplomat and Social Democratic politician who served as president of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/finland">Finland</a> from 1994 to 2000. As a <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/united-nations">United Nations</a> official he led the transition to Namibian independence in 1989–1990, and he later mediated in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/kosovo">Kosovo</a> in 1999, in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/aceh">Aceh</a> in 2005 and in the talks on Kosovo's status. He received the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/nobel-peace-prize">Nobel Peace Prize</a> in 2008 for his work resolving international conflicts.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/martti-ahtisaari.jpg" alt="Martti Ahtisaari" width="320" height="427" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Markku Niskanen · CC BY 4.0 · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Martti_Ahtisaari_M%C3%A4ntyniemess%C3%A4_(cropped).jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
<section class="enc-quotes"><h2 class="enc-section-title">Across the Institute</h2><ul><li><blockquote>Finnish diplomats and soldiers took part in United Nations peacekeeping, and former president <b>Martti Ahtisaari</b> received the Nobel Peace Prize in 2008 for his mediation in Namibia, Aceh and Kosovo.</blockquote><a href="/empire/republic-of-finland">Republic of Finland · Global &amp; Regional Impact</a></li></ul></section>
<section class="enc-where enc-born"><h2 class="enc-section-title">Born and died</h2><p class="enc-born-p">Born in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/vyborg">Vyborg</a>, in what is now <a href="/countries/russia">Russia</a>. Died in Helsinki, in what is now <a href="/countries/finland">Finland</a>. <span class="enc-born-src">Places as Wikidata records them.</span></p><figure class="st-locator enc-loc"><a href="/atlas?at=60.71,28.75&amp;year=1992" aria-label="Vyborg on the atlas"><svg class="map map-loc" viewBox="5147 136 900 540" role="img" aria-label="Map: the birthplace of Martti Ahtisaari"><image href="/maps/world.svg" x="0" y="0" width="10000" height="4393"/><path class="map-dot-halo" d="M5597 406h0"/><path class="map-dot-me" d="M5597 406h0"/></svg></a><figcaption>The dot marks the birthplace. <a href="/atlas?at=60.71,28.75&amp;year=1992">What was here in 1992? &rarr;</a></figcaption></figure></section>
